{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 19, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a dream come true. As soon as I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the vibrant culture and stunning landscapes. My first stop was Tokyo, where I marveled at the towering skyscrapers and bustling streets of Shibuya. I spent hours exploring the city's many temples and shrines, including the famous Meiji Shrine, where I found a peaceful oasis amidst the chaos.\n\nFrom Tokyo, I traveled to Kyoto, a city steeped in tradition and history. I strolled through the serene gardens of the Kinkaku-ji Temple, mesmerized by the golden pavilion's reflection in the surrounding pond. I also had the opportunity to experience a traditional tea ceremony, where I learned about the intricate rituals and customs surrounding this ancient practice.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was trying the delicious Japanese cuisine. From sushi to ramen, I sampled a wide range of dishes, each one more flavorful than the last. I was particularly impressed by the fresh seafood at the Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo, where I watched the early morning tuna auction.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience. The country's unique blend of tradition and modernity, combined with its stunning natural beauty, left a lasting impression on me. I look forward to returning one day and exploring more of what Japan has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.47522157430648804}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.00531415268778801}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25467249751091003}, {"token": " dream", "logprob": -2.3189857006073}, {"token": " come", "logprob": -4.887569048150908e-06}, {"token": " true", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "